+# Contributing
+
+Thanks for improving `awesome-best-open-source-ai-agents-2026`.
+
+## Submission Rules
+
+Every submission must meet all of these requirements:
+
+1. The tool must have a public `github.com` repository URL.
+2. The project must be open source with a visible license in the repository.
+3. No proprietary SaaS-only products.
+4. Include current metadata:
+   - repository URL
+   - stars
+   - primary language
+   - license
+   - last commit date
+   - category
+   - best-for summary
+5. Keep descriptions specific to the repository and avoid generic marketing copy.
+
